      "hash64": "E419964E647723A9",
      "text": "这么说来，其实我上周\\n也和my dear wife大吵了一架……\\r\\n但是我立刻道了歉，然后就和好了！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
